{
	"pages": [
		{
			"id": "LoonbeslagDetail",
			"route": "/loonbeslagen/:id",
			"type": "detail",
			"title": "Loonbeslag",
			"config": {
				"register": "hrmq",
				"schema": "Loonbeslag",
				"_note": "loonbeslag (2026-07-15): the WkrAssessmentDetail stat-tile precedent -- three headline KPIs (ordered amount, beslagvrije voet, total claim) lead the page since that is the exposure question HR checks first, then the full record (creditor/dossierRef/status/effectiveFrom/effectiveTo/activated*/settled*/withdrawn*) in the lb-data widget below. No lifecycleActions: Loonbeslag.status carries no x-openregister-lifecycle (design.md D5) -- the admin/HR-gate-before-resolve check a lifecycle guard's (object, action, userId) contract cannot express, so all three transitions are guarded api-call actions against LoonbeslagController instead. The withdraw action's `reason` param is currently a fixed default string (the manifest v2 api-call action type has no free-text prompt collection) -- a prompt-collecting modal is a named fast-follow (README). Admin/HR only, mirroring the Payroll nav group. Audit history is a sidebar tab.",
				"sidebar": {
					"enabled": true,
					"showMetadata": true
				},
				"widgets": [
					{
						"id": "stat",
						"type": "stat",
						"title": "Ordered amount",
						"icon": "CashMinus",
						"content": {
							"label": "Ordered amount",
							"caption": "per periode",
							"icon": "CashMinus",
							"valueColor": "#e9322d",
							"format": {
								"style": "number",
								"decimals": 2
							},
							"source": {
								"register": "hrmq",
								"schema": "Loonbeslag",
								"metric": "sum",
								"field": "orderedAmount",
								"filter": {
									"id": "@objectId"
								}
							}
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "stat-2",
						"type": "stat",
						"title": "Beslagvrije voet",
						"icon": "ShieldCheckOutline",
						"content": {
							"label": "Beslagvrije voet",
							"caption": "beschermd minimum",
							"icon": "ShieldCheckOutline",
							"valueColor": "#46ba61",
							"format": {
								"style": "number",
								"decimals": 2
							},
							"source": {
								"register": "hrmq",
								"schema": "Loonbeslag",
								"metric": "sum",
								"field": "beslagvrijeVoet",
								"filter": {
									"id": "@objectId"
								}
							}
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "stat-3",
						"type": "stat",
						"title": "Totale vordering",
						"icon": "CashMultiple",
						"content": {
							"label": "Totale vordering",
							"caption": "totaal beslag",
							"icon": "CashMultiple",
							"valueColor": "#0082c9",
							"format": {
								"style": "number",
								"decimals": 2
							},
							"source": {
								"register": "hrmq",
								"schema": "Loonbeslag",
								"metric": "sum",
								"field": "totalClaim",
								"filter": {
									"id": "@objectId"
								}
							}
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "data",
						"type": "data",
						"title": "Loonbeslag",
						"icon": "Gavel",
						"content": {
							"columns": 2,
							"exclude": [
								"employeeId"
							],
							"title": "Loonbeslag"
						}
					},
					{
						"id": "related",
						"type": "related",
						"title": "Related",
						"icon": "LinkVariant",
						"content": {
							"title": "Related"
						}
					}
				],
				"layout": [
					{
						"id": 1,
						"widgetId": "stat",
						"gridX": 0,
						"gridY": 0,
						"gridWidth": 4,
						"gridHeight": 3
					},
					{
						"id": 2,
						"widgetId": "stat-2",
						"gridX": 4,
						"gridY": 0,
						"gridWidth": 4,
						"gridHeight": 3
					},
					{
						"id": 3,
						"widgetId": "stat-3",
						"gridX": 8,
						"gridY": 0,
						"gridWidth": 4,
						"gridHeight": 3
					},
					{
						"id": 4,
						"widgetId": "data",
						"gridX": 0,
						"gridY": 3,
						"gridWidth": 8,
						"gridHeight": 12
					},
					{
						"id": 5,
						"widgetId": "related",
						"gridX": 8,
						"gridY": 3,
						"gridWidth": 4,
						"gridHeight": 12
					}
				],
				"headerActions": [
					{
						"id": "loonbeslag-activate",
						"label": "Verifiëren en activeren",
						"type": "api-call",
						"icon": "CheckCircleOutline",
						"url": "/api/loonbeslag/activate",
						"method": "POST",
						"params": {
							"loonbeslagId": "@objectId"
						},
						"confirm": true,
						"successMessage": "Loonbeslag geverifieerd en geactiveerd.",
						"errorMessage": "Activeren van het loonbeslag is mislukt."
					},
					{
						"id": "loonbeslag-settle",
						"label": "Markeer voldaan",
						"type": "api-call",
						"icon": "CashCheck",
						"url": "/api/loonbeslag/settle",
						"method": "POST",
						"params": {
							"loonbeslagId": "@objectId"
						},
						"confirm": true,
						"successMessage": "Loonbeslag gemarkeerd als voldaan.",
						"errorMessage": "Markeren als voldaan is mislukt."
					},
					{
						"id": "loonbeslag-withdraw",
						"label": "Intrekken",
						"type": "api-call",
						"icon": "CloseCircleOutline",
						"url": "/api/loonbeslag/withdraw",
						"method": "POST",
						"params": {
							"loonbeslagId": "@objectId",
							"reason": "Ingetrokken door beheerder/HR via het beheerpaneel."
						},
						"confirm": true,
						"successMessage": "Loonbeslag ingetrokken.",
						"errorMessage": "Intrekken van het loonbeslag is mislukt."
					}
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"pageInstances": [
		{
			"templateRef": "indexScaffold",
			"register": "hrmq",
			"schema": "Loonbeslag",
			"params": {
				"id": "Loonbeslagen",
				"route": "/loonbeslagen",
				"title": "Loonbeslagen",
				"columns": [
					"employeeId",
					"creditor",
					"dossierRef",
					"orderedAmount",
					"beslagvrijeVoet",
					"status",
					"effectiveFrom"
				],
				"sort": {
					"field": "effectiveFrom",
					"order": "desc"
				},
				"filters": [
					"status"
				],
				"description": "Court/deurwaarder-ordered wage garnishments (loonbeslag): de floor-clamped periodieke deductie op nettoPay -- nooit onder de beslagvrije voet -- gevouwen in de lopende loonrun na verrekening en verlofkoop-verkoop. Admin/HR-only; activeren/voldaan-markeren/intrekken via de gegroeide acties, nooit een kaal lifecycle-transitieknop.",
				"actions": [
					{
						"id": "create-loonbeslag",
						"label": "Loonbeslag registreren",
						"type": "open-form",
						"icon": "PlusCircleOutline",
						"register": "hrmq",
						"schema": "Loonbeslag",
						"onSuccessRoute": "LoonbeslagDetail",
						"successMessage": "Loonbeslag geregistreerd (status concept -- gebruik Verifiëren en activeren om deducties te starten)."
					}
				]
			}
		}
	]
}
